Pacific Rim: Uprising

Pacific Rim: Uprising inggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; fiksi ilmiah saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Steven%20S.%20DeKnight"&gt;Steven S. DeKnight&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénariyo anggitanipun DeKnight, &lt;a href="Emily%20Carmichael%20%28filmmaker%29"&gt;Emily Carmichael&lt;/a&gt;, Kira Snyder, lan &lt;a href="T.S.%20Nowlin"&gt;T.S. Nowlin&lt;/a&gt; dipunangkat saking cariyos anggitanipun &lt;a href="Guillermo%20del%20Toro"&gt;Guillermo del Toro&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika candhakan saking filem taun 2013 kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="Pacific%20Rim%20%28film%29"&gt;Pacific Rim&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="John%20Boyega"&gt;John Boyega&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scott%20Eastwood"&gt;Scott Eastwood&lt;/a&gt;, Cailee Spaeny dan &lt;a href="Jing%20Tian"&gt;Jing Tian&lt;/a&gt;, sesarengan &lt;a href="Rinko%20Kikuchi"&gt;Rinko Kikuchi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Charlie%20Day"&gt;Charlie Day&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Burn%20Gorman"&gt;Burn Gorman&lt;/a&gt; ingkang didhapuk malih awit saking filem sadèrèngipun. Filem punika badhé dipunbabar ing surya 23 Fèbruari 2018, déning &lt;a href="Universal%20Studios"&gt;Universal Pictures&lt;/a&gt;.
