<doc id="140817" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=140817" title="True Story (filem)">
True Story (filem)

True Story nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="thriller"&gt;thriller&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="misteri"&gt;misteri&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipundamel taun 2015. Filem punika dipunsutradarani &lt;a href="Rupert%20Goold"&gt;Rupert Goold&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar skénario anggitanipun Goold lan David Kajganich, dipunpundhut saking cathetan kanthi sesirah ingkang sami, anggitanipun &lt;a href="Michael%20Finkel"&gt;Michael Finkel&lt;/a&gt;. Para &lt;a href="juru%20paraga"&gt;juru paraga&lt;/a&gt; ingkang didhapuk maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Jonah%20Hill"&gt;Jonah Hill&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="James%20Franco"&gt;James Franco&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Felicity%20Jones"&gt;Felicity Jones&lt;/a&gt;, dipunsengkuyung déning &lt;a href="Gretchen%20Mol"&gt;Gretchen Mol&lt;/a&gt;, Betty Gilpin, lan &lt;a href="John%20Sharian"&gt;John Sharian&lt;/a&gt;.
Franco maragani minangka &lt;a href="Christian%20Longo"&gt;Christian Longo&lt;/a&gt;, setunggalipun priya ingkang saestu dipunpadosi déning &lt;a href="FBI"&gt;FBI&lt;/a&gt; awit saking dipundhakwa mejahi semah lan tiga putra lan putrinipun ing &lt;a href="Oregon"&gt;Oregon&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun ndhelik wonten &lt;a href="Meksiko"&gt;Meksiko&lt;/a&gt; kanthi ngginakaken idhentitas &lt;a href="Michael%20Finkel"&gt;Michael Finkel&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika, kaping pisan dipungyaraken nalika pangaji &lt;a href="Sundance%20Film%20Festival"&gt;Sundance Film Festival&lt;/a&gt; 2015 lan dipunbabar sesarengan ing surya 17 April 2015, ing Amérikah Sarékat.
