<doc id="141441" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=141441" title="Robert Sean Leonard">
Robert Sean Leonard

Robert Lawrence Leonard (#ALIH), kanthi asma panggung Robert Sean Leonard, nggih punika &lt;a href="juru%20paraga"&gt;juru paraga&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Namanipun sampun misuwur nalika maragani &lt;a href="James%20Wilson%20%28House%29"&gt;Dr. James Wilson&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; sèri tivi &lt;a href="House%20%28TV%20series%29"&gt;House&lt;/a&gt; (2004–2012) lan Neil Perry wonten ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Dead%20Poets%20Society"&gt;Dead Poets Society&lt;/a&gt;. Leonard nampi pangaji &lt;a href="Tony%20Award%20for%20Best%20Featured%20Actor%20in%20a%20Play"&gt;Tony Award for Best Featured Actor in a Play&lt;/a&gt; amargi kaprigelanipun maragani &lt;a href="The%20Invention%20of%20Love"&gt;The Invention of Love&lt;/a&gt; taun 2001. Kajawi punika, piyambakipun ugi maragani ing &lt;a href="Teater%20Broadway"&gt;Teater Broadway&lt;/a&gt; ingkang sesirah antawisipun &lt;a href="Candida%20%28play%29"&gt;Candida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Long%20Day%27s%20Journey%20Into%20Night"&gt;Long Day's Journey Into Night&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Breaking%20the%20Code"&gt;Breaking the Code&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Speed%20of%20Darkness%20%28play%29"&gt;The Speed of Darkness&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Philadelphia%2C%20Here%20I%20Come%21"&gt;Philadelphia, Here I Come!&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Arcadia%20%28play%29"&gt;Arcadia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Music%20Man"&gt;The Music Man&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Born%20Yesterday"&gt;Born Yesterday&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="To%20Kill%20a%20Mockingbird"&gt;To Kill a Mockingbird&lt;/a&gt;. Saking taun 2013 dumugi 2014, Leonard maragani minangka Dr. Roger Kadar ing sandhiwara sèri tivi sesirah &lt;a href="Falling%20Skies"&gt;Falling Skies&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Latar wingking</h2>
Latar wingking.
Leonard lair ing &lt;a href="Westwood%2C%20New%20Jersey"&gt;Westwood, New Jersey&lt;/a&gt;, putera saking Joyce Patricia (née Peterson), setunggalipun juru rawat, lan Robert Leonard, nggih punika guru ing &lt;a href="Collier%20High%20School"&gt;Collier High School&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun manggèn wonten &lt;a href="Ridgewood%2C%20New%20Jersey"&gt;Ridgewood&lt;/a&gt;, nglampahi sekolah wonten &lt;a href="Ridgewood%20High%20School%20%28New%20Jersey%29"&gt;Ridgewood High School&lt;/a&gt; lajeng kuliyah wonten ing &lt;a href="Fordham%20University"&gt;Fordham University&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Columbia%20University%20School%20of%20General%20Studies"&gt;Columbia University School of General Studies&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karier</h2>
Karier.
Leonard, kaping tiga naté mlebet nominasi badhé nampi pangaji &lt;a href="Tony%20Award"&gt;Tony Award&lt;/a&gt; (1993, 2001 dan 2003), lajeng saweg saget nampi pangaji ing taun 2001 (paraga saé piyambak) awit maragani minangka &lt;a href="A.%20E.%20Housman"&gt;A. E. Housman&lt;/a&gt;, karyanipun &lt;a href="Tom%20Stoppard"&gt;Tom Stoppard&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="The%20Invention%20of%20Love"&gt;The Invention of Love&lt;/a&gt;. Sadèrèngipun, piyambakipun ugi giyat wonten proyek-proyek Stoppard, maragani minangka Valentine ing filem &lt;a href="Arcadia%20%28play%29"&gt;Arcadia&lt;/a&gt; ing Lincoln Center taun 1995. Nominasi ingkang dipuntampi wonten taun 2003 saking Tony Award nggih punika awit maragani minangka Edmund Tyrone ing filem arahanipun &lt;a href="Eugene%20O%27Neill"&gt;Eugene O'Neill&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="Long%20Day%27s%20Journey%20Into%20Night"&gt;Long Day's Journey Into Night&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ugi dipunsengkuyung déning &lt;a href="Philip%20Seymour%20Hoffman"&gt;Philip Seymour Hoffman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brian%20Dennehy"&gt;Brian Dennehy&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Vanessa%20Redgrave"&gt;Vanessa Redgrave&lt;/a&gt;. Leonard ugi ngregengaken pagelaran musikal wonten Teater Broadway taun 2001 nggantosi &lt;a href="Craig%20Bierko"&gt;Craig Bierko&lt;/a&gt; minangka juru paraga utami, ing &lt;a href="The%20Music%20Man"&gt;The Music Man&lt;/a&gt;. Ing surya 8 Fèbruari 2011 dipunwartosaken bilih Leonard badhé dipundhapuk maragani minangka Paul Verrall ing pagelaran téater Broadway kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="Born%20Yesterday"&gt;Born Yesterday&lt;/a&gt; wiwitan wulan Maret. Tahun 1997, Leonard dados paraga ing filem tivi karyanipun &lt;a href="Christopher%20Reeve"&gt;Christopher Reeve&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="In%20the%20Gloaming%20%28film%29"&gt;In the Gloaming&lt;/a&gt;.
Saking taun 2004 piyambakipun gadhah jejibahan dados &lt;a href="James%20Wilson%20%28House%29"&gt;Dr. James Wilson&lt;/a&gt;, pangarsanipun Departemen &lt;a href="Oncology"&gt;Onkologi&lt;/a&gt; wonten sandhiwara seri &lt;a href="House%20%28TV%20series%29"&gt;House&lt;/a&gt; ing kanal &lt;a href="Fox%20Broadcasting%20Company"&gt;FOX&lt;/a&gt;. Sandhiwara punika dipunpungkasi ing taun 2012. Taun 2007 namanipun Leonard dipunserat wonten 100 pratélan Entertainment's Weekly' minangka "Dr. Underrated." Taun 2016, piyambakipun maragani minangka Raja Arthur wonten ing pagelaran musik karyanipun David Lee ingkang dipunsutradarani Camelot wonten Westport Country Playhouse Westport, CT.
