<doc id="141506" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=141506" title="Langit wengi">
Langit wengi

Pitembungan langit wengi mangku teges &lt;a href="Awang-awang"&gt;langit&lt;/a&gt; sing kasawang nalika &lt;a href="wengi"&gt;wengi&lt;/a&gt;. Istilah iki lumrahé gegayutan karo astronomi sing tegesé sesawanganing wewujudan langit kaya ta lintang, rembulan, lan planit-planit sing katon cetha ing langit sawisé wayah surup. Sumbering sunar sing alami tumraping langit wengi kalebu sunaring &lt;a href="rembulan"&gt;rembulan&lt;/a&gt;, sunaring &lt;a href="lintang"&gt;lintang&lt;/a&gt;, sorot udara (airglow), sing béda-béda gumantung papan lan wektuné. &lt;a href="Aurora"&gt;Aurora&lt;/a&gt; borealis nyunari langit ing &lt;a href="Arktik"&gt;Arktik&lt;/a&gt;, déné aurora australis ing kukuban &lt;a href="Antartika"&gt;Antarktik&lt;/a&gt;. Kala-kala, precetan gedhé koronah (coronal mass ejection) sing asalé saka &lt;a href="sreng%C3%A9ng%C3%A9"&gt;srengéngé&lt;/a&gt; utawa angin srengéngé (solar wind) sing gedhé bisa njalari aurora nyandhak &lt;a href="katulistiwa"&gt;katulistiwa&lt;/a&gt;.
