<doc id="143631" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=143631" title="Aditi">
Aditi

Miturut layang &lt;a href="Mahabharata"&gt;Mahabharata&lt;/a&gt;, Dewi Aditi (&lt;a href="basa%20Sanskerta"&gt;Sanskerta&lt;/a&gt;: अदिती; Aditī) iku putrane &lt;a href="Sang%20Hyang%20Daksa"&gt;Sang Hyang Daksa&lt;/a&gt;, utawa wayahe &lt;a href="Brahma"&gt;Bathara Brahma&lt;/a&gt;. Kagarwa &lt;a href="Resi%20Kasyapa"&gt;Maharesi Kasyapa&lt;/a&gt; (Maharesi ing kaswargan), peputra 12 (dwadasyaditya = Aditya 12). 
Wondene asmane para Aditya 12 (dwadasyaditya), yaiku: (1)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Datri"&gt;Hyang Datri&lt;/a&gt;, (2)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Mitra"&gt;Hyang Mitra&lt;/a&gt;, (3)&lt;a href="Bathara%20Indra"&gt;Hyang Sakra&lt;/a&gt; (Indra), (4)&lt;a href="Baruna"&gt;Hyang Bharuna&lt;/a&gt;, (5)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Angsa"&gt;Hyang Angsa&lt;/a&gt;, (6)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Waga"&gt;Hyang Waga&lt;/a&gt;, (7)&lt;a href="Bathara%20Surya"&gt;Hyang Wiwaswat&lt;/a&gt; (Bathara Surya), (8)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Pusa"&gt;Hyang Pusa&lt;/a&gt;, (9)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Sawitri"&gt;Hyang Sawitri&lt;/a&gt;, (10)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Ariyaman"&gt;Hyang Ariyaman&lt;/a&gt;, (11)&lt;a href="Hyang%20Twastri"&gt;Hyang Twastri&lt;/a&gt;, (12)&lt;a href="Wisnu"&gt;Hyang Wisnu&lt;/a&gt;. 
Tembung Aditya tegese putrane Aditi, tedhake Aditi. Salaras karo tegese Pandhawa (putrane &lt;a href="Pandhu"&gt;Pandhu&lt;/a&gt;), Yadawa turune &lt;a href="Yadu"&gt;Yadu&lt;/a&gt;, Ditya turune &lt;a href="Dewi%20Diti"&gt;Dewi Diti&lt;/a&gt;, Denawa trahe &lt;a href="Dewi%20Danu"&gt;Dewi Danu&lt;/a&gt;, lan sakpanunggale.
Miturut crita pedhalangan, Sang Hyang Sakra (Bathara Indra) lan Sang Hyang Wisnu iku putrane &lt;a href="Bathara%20Guru"&gt;Bathara Guru&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dewi%20Uma"&gt;Dewi Uma&lt;/a&gt; (Umayi). Dene, Hyang Wiwaswat (Bathara Surya) putrane &lt;a href="Sanghyang%20Ismaya"&gt;Sanghyang Ismaya&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dewi%20Senggani"&gt;Dewi Senggani&lt;/a&gt;.
Sarasilahe para dewa kang kasebut ing buku-buku pedhalangan, akeh-akehe mirip karo kang kasebut ing layang &lt;a href="Serat%20Paramayoga"&gt;Paramayoga&lt;/a&gt;.

