Wonten ing &lt;a href="film"&gt;film&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Transformers%20%28film%29"&gt;Transformers&lt;/a&gt; karyanipun sutradara &lt;a href="Michael%20Bay"&gt;Michael Bay&lt;/a&gt; punika, Decepticons medal kaliyan kathah anggota kadosdene Megatron, &lt;a href="Starscream"&gt;Starscream&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Frenzy"&gt;Frenzy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Blackout"&gt;Blackout&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Barricade%20%28Transformers%29"&gt;Barricade&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scorponok"&gt;Scorponok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Devastator"&gt;Devastator&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bonecrusher"&gt;Bonecrusher&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging namung kalih ingkang tasih urip dumugi pungkasaning cariyos film punika inggih punika Starscream lan Scorponok.
