<doc id="144042" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=144042" title="Gerd Baumann">
Gerd Baumann

Gerd Baumann ya iku tokoh &lt;a href="Antropologi"&gt;Antropologi&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Antropolog"&gt;Antropolog&lt;/a&gt;) saka Aachen, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; kalairan taun 1953. Pasinaoné olèh saka University of Cologne taun 1975 lan Ph.D. saka Queen’s University of Belfast taun 1980. Baumann naté nglakoni panalitèn lapangan ing pagunungan Nuba, &lt;a href="Sudan"&gt;Sudan&lt;/a&gt; (1976, 19780-1979) lan Southhall, &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt; (1986-1991). Karya-karya tulisané kang wis diterbitké kaya ta Contesting Culture: Discourses of Identity in Multi-Ethnic London (1996) lan The Multicultural Riddle. Re-Thinking National, Ethnic and Religious Identities (1999). Baumann ngetog ing watesan budaya (cultural boundary) lan lintas-budaya kolektif (collective crosscultural). Panalitèné ing Sudan iku nliti wong désa Nuba kang akèh didayani karo budaya &lt;a href="Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;. Akhir-akhir iki, Baumann mbalèni mraceka sinkrètisme agama, ritual lintas bebyaran, aesthetic crossovers, idhé-idhé plurikultural ngenani krabatan. Baumann séda taun 15 Januari 2014 nalika umuré 60 taun.
