<doc id="144664" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=144664" title="Nawawi al-Bantani">
Nawawi al-Bantani

Syekh Muhammad Nawawi al-Jawi al-Bantani (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: محمد نووي الجاوي البنتني‎‎) atawa Syekh Nawawi al-Bantani (lair ning &lt;a href="Tanara%2C%20Serang"&gt;Tanara, Serang&lt;/a&gt;, 1230 H/1813 M - séda ning &lt;a href="Mekah"&gt;Mekah&lt;/a&gt;, Hijaz 1314 H/1897 M) iku wong ngalim &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; kang dadi Imam &lt;a href="Masjid%20Al%20Karam"&gt;Masjidil Karam&lt;/a&gt;. Deweke duweni gelar al-Bantani kerana asale saking &lt;a href="Banten"&gt;Banten&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Deweke iku wong ngalim lan intelektual kang produktif pisan nulis kitab. Jumla karyanè bli kurang bli luwih saking 115 kitab kang nyrambahi babagan elmu &lt;a href="fiqih"&gt;fiqih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tauhid"&gt;tauhid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sufisme"&gt;tasawuf&lt;/a&gt;, tapsir, lan k&lt;a href="Kadis"&gt;adis&lt;/a&gt;.
Kerana kemoncerane, Syekh Nawawi al-Bantani banjur diceluk Sayyid Ulama al-Hijaz (Pangarep Ulama Hijaz), al-Imam al-Muhaqqiq wa al-Fahhamah al-Mudaqqiq (Imam kang linuwih elmune), A'yan Ulama al-Qarn al-Ram Asyar li al-Ijrah (Tokoh Ulama Abad 14 &lt;a href="Pananggalan%20Hijriyah"&gt;Hijriyah&lt;/a&gt;), sampe Imam Ulama al-Haramain, (Imam 'Ulama Rong Kota Suci).

